{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國女星安恩真去年以嘉賓身份亮相綜藝節目《Running Man》（RM），玩「親吻猜人」遊戲時，由出演者蒙上眼睛，猜測親吻自己的人是誰。</p><p>她親吻梁世燦的手腕，隨後又被要求再親一次，有觀眾質疑節目疑似強迫女星親吻他人的畫面，引發性騷擾爭議。</p><p>最</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:21:54.810108+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:17:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T09:18:12.281242+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:18:12.281242+00:00","content_hash":"9dee3c79956b4b5838f1528832a41c4784ab8298863e303f1fb8cf457bf69e18","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}